CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvfs DEFINITION PUBLIC FINAL CREATE PUBLIC.
 PUBLIC SECTION.
 TYPES: BEGIN OF ty_row, n TYPE i, END OF ty_row.
 CLASS-METHODS row RETURNING VALUE(r) TYPE ty_row.
 CLASS-METHODS run RETURNING VALUE(rv) TYPE string.
ENDCLASS.
CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvfs IMPLEMENTATION.
 METHOD row. r-n = 42. ENDMETHOD.
 METHOD run.
 DATA nums TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF i WITH DEFAULT KEY. DATA n TYPE i.
 FIELD-SYMBOLS <n> TYPE i.
 APPEND 1 TO nums. READ TABLE nums INDEX 1 ASSIGNING <n>.
 CALL METHOD ('ZCL_GOGEN_T_DYNRECV')=>('NUM') RECEIVING result = <n>.
 READ TABLE nums INDEX 1 INTO n. rv = |{ n }|.
 ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.
